&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryLote DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryLote :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
        WHERE  {&TableName}.nr-seq-tipo-lote >= i-nr-seq-tipo-lote-ini
        AND    {&TableName}.nr-seq-tipo-lote <= i-nr-seq-tipo-lote-fim
        AND    {&TableName}.des-lote         >= c-des-lote-ini
        AND    {&TableName}.des-lote         <= c-des-lote-fim
        BY     {&TableName}.des-lote.


    RETURN "OK":u.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

